WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:23.421
Bird flew over the park.

2
00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:28.667
She saw Kip standing on the path.

3
00:00:28.668 --> 00:00:31.256
He wore a hat and a badge.

4
00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:33.307
He had a whistle.

5
00:00:33.308 --> 00:00:36.100
Kip looked very serious.

6
00:00:36.101 --> 00:00:40.314
Bird flew down.

7
00:00:40.315 --> 00:00:43.281
"What are you doing?" asked Bird.

8
00:00:43.282 --> 00:00:49.708
"I'm a police officer," said Kip.

9
00:00:49.709 --> 00:00:52.454
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

10
00:00:52.455 --> 00:00:55.938
"You're not a police officer, Kip."

11
00:00:55.939 --> 00:00:58.606
"Yes, I am," said Kip.

12
00:00:58.607 --> 00:01:04.356
"Watch this."

13
00:01:04.357 --> 00:01:06.717
A woman ran on the path.

14
00:01:06.718 --> 00:01:10.735
Kip blew his whistle.

15
00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:15.071
"Slow down!" he said.

16
00:01:15.072 --> 00:01:19.178
The woman ran past Kip.

17
00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:24.210
"She didn’t hear me," said Kip.

18
00:01:24.211 --> 00:01:26.899
A boy rode a bike on the path.

19
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.431
Kip blew his whistle again.

20
00:01:29.432 --> 00:01:33.154
"Slow down!" said Kip.

21
00:01:33.155 --> 00:01:35.517
The boy rode past Kip.

22
00:01:35.518 --> 00:01:46.162
Kip frowned.

23
00:01:46.163 --> 00:01:51.759
A girl dropped a bag in the grass.

24
00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:56.601
"No littering!" yelled Kip.

25
00:01:56.602 --> 00:02:00.298
But the girl didn't even look at him.

26
00:02:00.299 --> 00:02:05.535
Kip sighed. "You're right, Bird.

27
00:02:05.536 --> 00:02:09.987
I'm not a police officer."
